# DEEP profile: openai/gpt-oss-120b (MXFP4 MoE, 117B total / 5.1B active) on vLLM 0.28, GB10 (SM121).
# Exclusive with fast. Weights ~61 GiB; util 0.80 of 121 GiB leaves ~24 GB for the OS/GUI (Nemotron left ~5).
# Backend notes (2026-10-13): Marlin is the MXFP4 MoE path that produces correct Harmony output on SM121
# (vllm#37030 was about older builds; validated on GB10 since 0.23). CUTLASS/FlashInfer MXFP4 paths need a
# patched build. Parsers: reasoning openai_gptoss (harmony channels), tool calls openai.
VLLM_IMAGE=vllm/vllm-openai:v0.28.0
MODEL_PATH=/models/gpt-oss-120b
SERVED_NAME=deep
LLM_PORT=8000
MAX_MODEL_LEN=131072
GPU_MEM_UTIL=0.80
MODEL_ARGS=--quantization mxfp4 --moe-backend marlin --async-scheduling --enable-chunked-prefill --max-num-seqs 8 --reasoning-parser openai_gptoss --tool-call-parser openai --trust-remote-code
# Reasoning depth is per request (reasoning_effort low|medium|high, default medium); the agent uses the default.
